WEBVTT

00:05:30.708 --> 00:05:32.018
DB: OK, so it's important,

00:05:32.042 --> 00:05:34.893
because we ask different questions
depending how old we are.

00:05:34.917 --> 00:05:36.934
Just say, "I'll take it" again.

00:05:36.958 --> 00:05:38.726
Jessica: I'll take it.

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.809
DB: Virginia? You're from Virginia?
Jessica: Yes, I am.

00:05:41.833 --> 00:05:43.518
DB: Yeah. So --

00:05:43.542 --> 00:05:44.809
(Laughter)

00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:46.559
I think this is a lady,

00:05:46.583 --> 00:05:51.934
I think this is a lady
who wants to leave Virginia.

00:05:51.958 --> 00:05:54.518
I think you're looking at plans,

00:05:54.542 --> 00:05:57.601
it's whether or not things
are going to come together to get out.

00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:58.875
Just show me your hands.